\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>χ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> by direct computation.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch23-algebras/08-characters.html"}